SafariZone_West_Text_KogaPatrolsSafariEverySoOften::
    .string "The SAFARI ZONE's huge, wouldn't\n"
    .string "you say?\p"
    .string "FUCHSIA's GYM LEADER, KOGA, \n"
    .string "patrols the grounds every so often.\p"
    .string "Thanks to him, we can play here\n"
    .string "knowing that we're safe.$"

SafariZone_West_Text_WeakenMonsBeforeCatching::
    .string "Wild POKéMON with low HP are\n"
    .string "easier to catch.\p"
    .string "Wear them down first, but be\n"
    .string "careful not to knock them out!$"

SafariZone_West_Text_StatusMakesMonsEasierToCatch::
    .string "If a POKéMON is asleep or\n"
    .string "paralyzed, it's much easier to\l"
    .string "catch.\p"
    .string "Bring a POKéMON that knows moves\n"
    .string "like SLEEP POWDER!$"

SafariZone_West_Text_HikedLotsDidntSeeMonIWanted::
    .string "I hiked a lot, but I didn't see any\n"
    .string "POKéMON I wanted.$"

